    "comment_data": [
        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Managing completion is done [with built-in tools as much as possible](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/a535342b6105a684f16114f598d44318e6a1d20f/doc/mini-completion.txt#L13-L14). The completion list in popup is done via built-in completion popup which (currently) can't have borders. There are plans to add it upstream though (see neovim/neovim#25541).\r\n\r\nClosing as duplicate of #1168 and #741\r\n\r\n",
